{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"healing_remedy","model_identifier":"healing_remedy","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## healing_remedy\n\nMedicine prop.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (0 rotated). Texture 16x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.3..1.3, y -3.0..3.4, z -1.3..1.3 (size 2.6 x 6.4 x 2.6 u = 7 x 18 x 7 cm).\nHealing remedy: a stoppered glass bottle (~18 cm) of bright green liquid with a linen label round it; the green liquid shows through the glass (the top row of the body is the empty glass above the liquid line), a highlight stripe down one edge. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n"},"description":"## healing_remedy\n\nMedicine prop.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32 (padded from 16x16; UVs unchanged), 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.3..1.3, y -3.0..3.4, z -1.3..1.3 (size 2.6 x 6.4 x 2.6 u = 7 x 18 x 7 cm).\nHealing remedy: a stoppered glass bottle (~18 cm) of bright green liquid with a linen label round it; the green liquid shows through the glass (the top row of the body is the empty glass above the liquid line), a highlight stripe down one edge. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"bottle","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.25,-3.0,-1.25],"to":[1.25,1.0,1.25],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,2.5,4.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[3,0,5.5,4.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[6,0,8.5,4.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[9,0,11.5,4.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[12,0,14.5,2.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,4